<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; background-color: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; margin: auto; text-align: center;">

      <img src="https://localhost:808/assets/logo/saasy-white.png"
           alt="SaaSy Logo"
           style="max-width: 120px; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto 20px;" />

      <h2 style="color: #333;">Welcome to SaaSy, {{.Name}}!</h2>
      <p>We're thrilled to have you on board.</p>

      <p>Your account is ready — let's get you started:</p>

      <p>
        <a href="https://saasy.app/login" style="
          background-color: #4CAF50;
          color: white;
          padding: 12px 24px;
          text-decoration: none;
          border-radius: 5px;
          display: inline-block;
          font-weight: bold;">
          Login to Your Dashboard
        </a>
      </p>

      <p>If you have questions, just reply to this email. We're here to help.</p>

      <p style="color: #888;">— The SaaSy Team</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
